{"version":1,"key":"card:574","content":{"id":574,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"短轮询、长轮询、SSE 和 WebSocket 异同点的比较。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"008d6d3c-1ef9-45c5-b03c-ea9c7e1e1817","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"共同点：为了和服务端进行（准）实时通信。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"31d1128e-d8d1-4dcf-bd67-b449a2668ade","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"区别：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"51b9ede5-4478-4b51-819b-8304fb13879e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"短轮询：每隔一段时间发起请求，获取服务端状态信息，服务端有数据就返回，无数据就返回空数据，一个应用场景是扫码登陆校验，轮询是否登陆成功","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"fbec84f4-bbd1-4893-af5b-2598df870ecd","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"chart":"sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as Client\n    participant S as Server\n\n    loop 每T秒轮询\n        C->>S: 请求数据\n        alt 服务器有数据\n            S->>C: 返回数据\n        else 无数据\n            S->>C: 返回空响应\n        end\n    end","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"62361ba7-b477-44eb-a5c4-4a684396f8f4","tauContract":"1c918d7603a3e3ecd29f011e4bab52bce848fe941bcb9a9dcf18f1024e918a5d","type":"mermaid"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"服务端和客户端的处理都很简单","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"337be34e-72f9-4c1d-accc-d0a477491992","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"7f070e73-8d6d-4403-92c4-29df2346a0bd","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"间隔不太好控制，间隔长，实时性不强，间隔短，对服务器有压力","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d379e5f3-e640-42b7-9851-df8ee65d51a3","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"f3601159-a762-438b-962c-9f7bd566a326","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"f907ec88-9e73-47ff-ae5a-a750ff28a8e2","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"collabId":"ffd5b6dd-eda2-4c3a-b57a-d0559b0af215","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"长轮询：发起一次请求，客户端和服务端保持连接，服务端轮询是否存在状态变化，数据发生就将消息返回回来，断开连接（或超时断开连接），然后客户端重新发送请求，不断重复这个流程","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"92259418-158b-470c-bdbe-70d80fbd36c8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"chart":"sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as Client\n    participant S as Server\n\n    C->>S: 请求数据\n    S-->>C: （等待，直到数据到达或超时）\n    alt 数据到达\n        S->>C: 返回数据\n    else 超时\n        S->>C: 返回空响应\n    end\n    C->>S: 立即重新请求（重复流程）","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0d1a822a-cb46-4bb8-8823-5130c85176b3","tauContract":"1c918d7603a3e3ecd29f011e4bab52bce848fe941bcb9a9dcf18f1024e918a5d","type":"mermaid"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"相比短轮询，发送的请求次数减少，实时性也更强，但处理起来也更复杂","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"131e6858-b9e1-4692-a548-7e988ae97039","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"8b8c1073-7cf1-493b-8ba0-e12d923f2c4c","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"b09a53d7-f732-410c-b797-2f90c615e8d4","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"collabId":"acb34b24-a974-467b-bc8b-e9f4beb0a06b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"SSE（Server-Sent Event）：单向服务器推送","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5e415913-2d6f-4f48-af64-f29d3d481c57","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"chart":"sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as Client\n    participant S as Server\n\n    C->>S: 建立SSE连接（HTTP长连接）\n    loop 持续推送\n        S->>C: 推送数据（text/event-stream格式）\n    end\n    alt 连接中断\n        C->>S: 自动重连\n    end","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2e585ef5-409b-4821-9080-3d420bde5c74","tauContract":"1c918d7603a3e3ecd29f011e4bab52bce848fe941bcb9a9dcf18f1024e918a5d","type":"mermaid"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"短轮询和长轮询都需要客户端不断发送请求，然后服务端返回结果，而 SSE 是服务端推送","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"446e83f5-b7f2-4837-ae16-94e61d9bfa9d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"03ddeb39-e2fe-4b28-aec3-f2d5618f73c3","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"本质上还是 HTTP 长连接，返回的 Content-Type 为 text/event-stream，当服务端有数据更新时，可以通过 text/event-stream 持续推送数据","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"27f97c8b-244c-4ca4-b05c-ecae0234fe3a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"9c435093-c77a-497c-9a21-a0af726f4eba","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"只能推送文本信息，对于二进制信息需要编码为文本","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"221dd6f2-2144-4c5c-9422-3fefa91a0a08","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"76fc75b1-85c4-4639-9dc5-7203a3968b68","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"当发生连接中断时可以自动重连","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"15ba790c-3dd2-4225-82ff-8770395d2cae","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"2ab668df-d39d-4d3b-b5f3-b2a7a213a382","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"d7be905f-6c72-40df-8f0d-f9c4cb2c4567","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"应用场景：新闻推送，股票行情，流式对话","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f3be5d27-994d-4809-87cd-5f4a8627a0c4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"81c9b574-a050-42b2-918c-a78bead094b6","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"WebSocket：全双工通信","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"30bfff44-65cb-4511-93cb-4445eb59f9e2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"双向通信","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"af29da89-77ff-4731-b76f-b01d22885f81","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"1d2dd195-1500-493d-b704-514e71f791a2","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"实时性强","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2a7e7fd9-5a95-4435-9bfb-adc2ba8e7e23","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"1f23e155-241f-41c6-bd52-f4ac80b38cb4","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"78239f83-f9b1-4096-84ef-bc7283d76f09","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"chart":"sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as Client\n    participant S as Server\n\n    C->>S: HTTP Upgrade请求（WebSocket握手）\n    S->>C: 返回101状态码（协议切换）\n    loop 持久连接\n        S->>C: 主动推送数据\n        C->>S: 发送数据\n    end","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"aed154c4-7eb5-41e4-bc10-a4e3901fe259","tauContract":"1c918d7603a3e3ecd29f011e4bab52bce848fe941bcb9a9dcf18f1024e918a5d","type":"mermaid"},{"children":[{"text":"常用于对实时性特别高的场景：在线游戏，实时协作","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8ccf009e-1e2a-42a9-89e8-60accfe39eda","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"07e6c0fc-1f92-4728-b51f-6539aa977d21","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"05d98d83-cb1d-4415-84eb-c6eb44501a5b","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"tags":["概念对比","面试题","短轮询","长轮询","SSE","WebSocket"],"createTime":1744949641386,"updateTime":1793532558366,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532558366}}